# Optional private overlay (NOT shipped with public install content)

Copy to `~/.kiro/context/private.md` on your machines only.
Never commit real contents to the public `kiro-config` repo.

Suggested sections (fill locally):
- Active clients / projects (short codes only if needed)
- Cloud account / project identifiers
- Domains, clusters, notable endpoints
- Paths to local report assets and assessment scripts
- Pointers to canonical private session summaries

Agents that need facts should read this file when present, and otherwise ask.
